WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie face down with the legs wide, toes turned out, heels falling in.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Stack the hands or forearms and rest the forehead on them.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Let the whole front body melt into the mat.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the belly and feel it press the floor.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
To exit, press back gently into Child's Pose.
